#: src/routes/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "The Android permission <0/> and your browser's microphone permission allow live voice communication in shared worlds. With permission, microphone audio is sent through WebRTC to connected participants, including the participant hosting the world. Spatial playback reflects participants' positions. You can deny or revoke microphone access in your browser or device settings and continue using Kithin without transmitting your voice."
