msgid "Authentication cookies keep you signed in. A language cookie and browser storage remember preferences. Local storage and IndexedDB can hold settings, drafts, downloaded assets and local inventory. You can clear these through browser settings; doing so may sign you out or remove local content that has not been saved elsewhere."
msgstr "Authentication cookies keep you signed in. A language cookie and browser storage remember preferences. Local storage and IndexedDB can hold settings, drafts, downloaded assets and local inventory. You can clear these through browser settings; doing so may sign you out or remove local content that has not been saved elsewhere."

#~ msgid "Account information and saved content are kept while needed to provide your account and the storage or publications you request. Session records have expiry times. Support correspondence and security records are kept as needed to resolve requests, investigate abuse or meet legal obligations. Live voice and movement streams are processed during use rather than archived by Kithin."
#~ msgstr "Account information and saved content are kept while needed to provide your account and the storage or publications you request. Session records have expiry times. Support correspondence and security records are kept as needed to resolve requests, investigate abuse or meet legal obligations. Live voice and movement streams are processed during use rather than archived by Kithin."

#~ msgid "You can request account and personal data deletion by email. Some information may need to be retained to meet legal obligations or resolve disputes. Shared assets can remain where they are still referenced by other users' content, and copies held by other participants are outside Kithin's control. Clearing browser storage does not delete your cloud account."
