#: src/routes/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Where the GDPR applies, we process account information, saved content and the connection and movement data necessary to deliver the features you request to perform our service agreement with you. We rely on legitimate interests in protecting users and the service for proportionate security and abuse prevention, and on legal obligations when processing is required by law. Browser and headset permissions control technical access to your microphone and tracking features; they do not by themselves establish a legal basis for every use of that information. Where a use requires your consent, you may withdraw it at any time by contacting us, and you can stop microphone or tracking access through device or browser settings. Withdrawal does not affect the lawfulness of processing before it occurred."
msgstr "Where the GDPR applies, we process account information, saved content and the connection and movement data necessary to deliver the features you request to perform our service agreement with you. We rely on legitimate interests in protecting users and the service for proportionate security and abuse prevention, and on legal obligations when processing is required by law. Browser and headset permissions control technical access to your microphone and tracking features; they do not by themselves establish a legal basis for every use of that information. Where a use requires your consent, you may withdraw it at any time by contacting us, and you can stop microphone or tracking access through device or browser settings. Withdrawal does not affect the lawfulness of processing before it occurred."

#: src/routes/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Account details are required to create and authenticate an account. Without them, account features are unavailable. Microphone access and optional AI features are voluntary. Movement and connection information are necessary for the interactive multiplayer features you choose to use. Kithin does not use your personal information for automated decisions that produce legal or similarly significant effects."
msgstr "Account details are required to create and authenticate an account. Without them, account features are unavailable. Microphone access and optional AI features are voluntary. Movement and connection information are necessary for the interactive multiplayer features you choose to use. Kithin does not use your personal information for automated decisions that produce legal or similarly significant effects."

#: src/routes/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "If you use the optional Studio AI assistant, your prompts, conversation and scene information provided to the assistant are sent to the AI provider you select. For supported cloud providers, requests and the credential you supply pass through Kithin's server to that provider. Supported providers include OpenAI, Anthropic (Claude), OpenCode and OpenRouter. Custom and local endpoints connect directly from your browser. The API key you enter is held in memory for the current page session; Kithin does not save it in browser storage or its database. Provider preferences are saved in your browser. Provider retention and use are governed by that provider's terms and privacy policy. Do not include information you do not want to share with that provider."
msgstr "If you use the optional Studio AI assistant, your prompts, conversation and scene information provided to the assistant are sent to the AI provider you select. For supported cloud providers, requests and the credential you supply pass through Kithin's server to that provider. Supported providers include OpenAI, Anthropic (Claude), OpenCode and OpenRouter. Custom and local endpoints connect directly from your browser. The API key you enter is held in memory for the current page session; Kithin does not save it in browser storage or its database. Provider preferences are saved in your browser. Provider retention and use are governed by that provider's terms and privacy policy. Do not include information you do not want to share with that provider."

#~ msgid "You can request account and personal data deletion by email. Some information may need to be retained to meet legal obligations or resolve disputes. Shared files may remain referenced by other users' content. This does not remove your right to request erasure of personal information contained in those files; we assess such requests under applicable law. Copies independently held by other participants are outside Kithin's control. Clearing browser storage does not delete your cloud account."
#~ msgstr "You can request account and personal data deletion by email. Some information may need to be retained to meet legal obligations or resolve disputes. Shared files may remain referenced by other users' content. This does not remove your right to request erasure of personal information contained in those files; we assess such requests under applicable law. Copies independently held by other participants are outside Kithin's control. Clearing browser storage does not delete your cloud account."

#: src/routes/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Depending on applicable law, you may request access, correction, deletion, a portable copy of your information, restriction of processing or object to processing. Contact <0/> to exercise these rights. Where the GDPR applies, we respond without undue delay and within one month of receiving your request. If complexity or the number of requests requires an extension of up to two further months, we will explain the reason within the first month. Requests are normally free; applicable law allows a reasonable fee or refusal for manifestly unfounded or excessive requests. You can also complain to your local data protection authority, including the <1>Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD)</1>."
msgstr "Depending on applicable law, you may request access, correction, deletion, a portable copy of your information, restriction of processing or object to processing. Contact <0/> to exercise these rights. Where the GDPR applies, we respond without undue delay and within one month of receiving your request. If complexity or the number of requests requires an extension of up to two further months, we will explain the reason within the first month. Requests are normally free; applicable law allows a reasonable fee or refusal for manifestly unfounded or excessive requests. You can also complain to your local data protection authority, including the <1>Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD)</1>."

