msgid "The Quest package opens the same Kithin web service. The current Kithin implementation does not integrate Meta account identifiers, Meta in-app purchases or a separate third-party diagnostics SDK. Android application backups are disabled by the packaging process. Meta and the browser may independently process platform information under their own policies."
