#: src/routes/privacy/+page.svelte
msgid "Connected participants receive the information needed to take part in the same world. WebRTC connections can expose network addresses to peers. Google STUN (stun.l.google.com) processes network information, including your IP address, to help devices connect. STUN discovers connection addresses; it does not carry your voice conversations or shared world content. Content you publish or share can be accessed by its intended audience, and recipients may keep copies."
